@startuml uc-pat-01-comm-alt-a8
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8

title UC-PAT-01: Manage My Appointments (C5 v1.1.0)\nCommunication Diagram - Alternative Flow A8: Appointment Not Owned by the Patient

actor ":Patient" as pat
boundary ":MyAppointmentsUI" as ui
control ":PatientAppointmentController" as ctrl
control ":PatientAppointmentService" as srv
control ":AccessControlService (C1)" as c1
entity ":Booking" as booking
control ":AuditService (C1)" as audit

pat -- ui : 1: selectAppointment(otherBookingId) [e.g. edited URL] >\n< 6: displayAccessDenied()

ui -- ctrl : 2: GET my-appointments/{otherBookingId} >\n< 5: HTTP 403 (UNAUTHORIZED_BOOKING_ACCESS)

ctrl -- srv : 3: getAppointmentDetails(otherBookingId, actorId, role) >\n< 4: throw UnauthorizedBookingAccessException

srv -- c1 : 3.1: canManageOwnAppointments(actorId, role) -> true >

srv -- booking : 3.2: isOwnedBy(actorId) -> false >

srv -- audit : 3.3: recordEvent(APPOINTMENT_ACCESS_DENIED, otherBookingId) >

note bottom of srv
  Same check for confirm, reschedule request and cancel.
  Role is not PATIENT (3.1 -> false): also 403 + audit.
  Booking does not exist: 404 BOOKING_NOT_FOUND.
  No data of the other patient is returned.
end note
@enduml
